-- Worker roles (database/grants/workers.sql, DEC-08)

-- ATLANTECH worker roles (DEC-08, CT-17 §6 and §7).
-- Generated from the DEC-08 "Final grants" matrix. Edit it in the same PR as any migration that
-- changes a table or column a worker reads or writes (label ai-impact).
--
-- Run while connected to the port database (grants use the current database).
-- No secrets here: the accounts w_part1 ... w_part3 are created by
-- `php artisan atlantech:worker-accounts`, which runs this file first, then grants each account its role.
--
-- Rules: SELECT on every port table except audit_logs, notification_logs, user_devices and
-- recommendation_reviews; users and license_states column-level only; no DELETE, no DDL;
-- workers insert new rows, the Backend retires old ones.

